-But shouldn't [\emergencystretch] also be a function of
-[what would be called in Plain TeX]
-\hsize ?  ** Phil.

I don't think that \emergencystretch could sensibly have any
relation to \hsize; it certainly shouldn't have a relationship of
    E=3DcH
(E=3D\emergencystretch, H=3D\hsize, c=3D an arbitrary positive
constant) since the need for a large E increases as H
*decreases*.
    E=3Dk-cH
(k is a large positive value, c as above) would not be much
better since excessively large values for E for small H would
give terrible results. I have yet to see any application where it
makes sense for E=3Df(H) for *any*  f.

-dh


